OL,3,AProtesters across Spain demand action
OL,4,Aover housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtests are taking place across Spain
OL,7,Fcalling for greater protections for
OL,8,Ftenants after the government failed to
OL,9,Fget emergency housing legislation
OL,10,Fthrough parliament on Friday.
OL,12,FAbout 50 planned marches were expected
OL,13,Fto take place in cities such as Madrid,
OL,14,FValencia and Barcelona on Saturday -
OL,15,Fwith some already under way.
OL,17,F"There is a lot of anger in the
OL,18,Fstreets," said a spokesperson for the
OL,19,FValencia Tenants' Union, where a
OL,20,Fdemonstration has already started.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
